  "title": "UAC Bypass via fodhelper.exe Registry Hijack",
  "description": "Detects the fodhelper.exe auto-elevation UAC bypass in which HKCU\\Software\\Classes\\ms-settings\\shell\\open\\command is populated to run an attacker command with elevated integrity.",
